TI  - BIOLOGICAL TREATMENT OF TANNERY WASTEWATER PRE-TREATED BY COAGULATION USING Moringua oleifera AS NATURAL COAGULANT
AU  - Tomkouani Kodom
AU  - Abirami Balakrishnan
AU  - B Lekshmi
